Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:55:54 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Send path: HERMES_KEEP_TOOL_IMAGES=int|all (default 3); 'all'
 keeps older screenshot tool results byte-stable so a local engine's cache
 survives, images retire only at compression

---
 agent/anthropic_message_convert.py            |  14 +-
 agent/context_compressor.py                   |  53 +++-
 tests/agent/test_outbound_keep_tool_images.py | 263 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 322 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/agent/test_outbound_keep_tool_images.py

