     persisted history — the rewrite is send-path only.
+
+    ``keep_newest=None`` (default) resolves ``HERMES_KEEP_TOOL_IMAGES``
+    (default 3); ``"all"`` keeps every image so request N+1 is a
+    byte-prefix-extension of request N. Compression still retires via the explicit
